name: Odd Todd — odd-rank chips
author: corpus
description: >-
  Odd Todd gives played odd-rank cards (A, 9, 7, 5, 3) +31 Chips when scored.
  First-shop chip engine: Hack retriggers played 3s and 5s for double Odd Todd
  chips; pairs with Even Steven to cover both parities.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: OddTodd
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: Hack
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: EvenSteven
    antes: [1, 2]
    score: 20
